{"3304340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ELARIENNE", "steam_appid": 3304340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.poster.avif?t=1771081499\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.webm?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.mp4?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELARIENNE: Strategy decides the battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One summon can change the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable variables form your army, and only precise strategy carries you to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All unit summons are random, from common tiers to ultra-rare ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 tiers in total, and 3 races: human, elf, and orc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race has a completely different combat style, making every team build fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to create your dream lineup? It’s your choices and strategy that overcome uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world consumed by darkness, it is your judgment that will protect <strong>ELARIENNE</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/d65fceaa66c63e096f6ebeef8a1ccc8f.poster.avif?t=1771081499\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/d65fceaa66c63e096f6ebeef8a1ccc8f.webm?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/d65fceaa66c63e096f6ebeef8a1ccc8f.mp4?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Runes: Luck or Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What matters more—luck or strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Epic bosses to choose from three random runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune gives you another chance to shape your strategy—or roll the dice again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/85a5a185849b299ad002b07ab256d028.poster.avif?t=1771081499\" width=540 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/85a5a185849b299ad002b07ab256d028.webm?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/85a5a185849b299ad002b07ab256d028.mp4?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive 150 Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear in waves and follow a fixed looping path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don’t defeat them, they stay on the field and stack with future waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let 70 enemies build up on the map, or fail to kill a boss before time runs out, and your run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When too many monsters gather, the darkness consumes ELARIENNE and the world falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the line before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.poster.avif?t=1771081499\" width=640 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.webm?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.mp4?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Yet Tactical</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The units you summon shape how you choos어켕ㅇㅇㅇㅇㅇㅇㅇe runes and upgrades—turning randomness into strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will luck be on your side? Or will you fall to the darkness?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.poster.avif?t=1771081499\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.webm?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.mp4?t=1771081499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.poster.avif?t=1771081499\" width=640 height=30